      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAROOGA JIM (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by one length at Shepparton in a handy 25.19 beating Hartland Willow. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts. Great chance to get the job done again. NO EXIT (1) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when second (24.76) at this track in a Grade 5. Expected to do much better this time. BROKEN HALO (8) is having his first start around this course. In the money last start when third (27.62) at Horsham over 485m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to be in this for a long way. DR. EXCLAIM (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
